Suggested commit: `feat(settings): complete native settings and keybindings`

Parent Goal: #182

## Goal
Upgrade connection management beyond basic CRUD so large multi-environment workspaces remain organized.

## Scope
- folders/groups;
- tags;
- favorite/pin connection;
- duplicate connection;
