Merge independently to latest main.
Suggested commit: `feat(connections): add organization and profile management`

Parent Goal: #182
Authority: `docs/goals/goal-phase-h-ai.md`

## Goal
Expand Agent capabilities only by composing canonical application services/tools; no second DB execution stack.

## Candidate capabilities
- Explain SQL / query plan;
- optimize slow query;
- suggest indexes;
- generate migration from schema diff;
- compare schemas;
- analyze sampled data;
- monitoring/admin assistant once Phase D exists.

## Rules
- every tool maps to a canonical service/action;
- bounded context/result payloads;
- provider capability checks;
- mutation/admin/destructive actions require explicit preview/confirmation;
- no autonomous destructive execution;
- no direct provider adapter access from Agent.

## Acceptance
- define/add only tools whose underlying human action is already production-ready;
- tool idempotency/cancellation/audit follows existing Agent workflow;
- result sampling/budgets preserved;
- live provider tests for each new tool;
- UI activity accurately shows action/confirmation/result.

Merge independently; split into child issues if more than one underlying service must be built.
Suggested commit: `feat(agent): extend typed database assistance tools`

